Main implementation entry points:
- \ref pre_c_sumo::run in pre_c_sumo_lib.hpp / pre_c_sumo_lib.cpp
- \ref pre_c_sumo::readCsumoSettingsFile in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
- \ref pre_c_sumo::receiveFFData in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
