- \ref pre_c_sumo::convertNFtoConnectedSinkSources in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
- \ref pre_c_sumo_connected_sink_sources_write_to_precice in connected_sinks_sources.hpp / connected_sinks_sources.cpp

\section notes Diagram Source Files
Diagrams are maintained in docs/include as .dot and .drawio source files.
Use the dotfile command for .dot diagrams in Doxygen and the image command for embedded SVG assets.
*/


